## The 5 Blueprint Personas (evaluate against all that apply)
 
| Persona | Budget sensitivity | Tech comfort | Primary goal | Patience for complexity |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Student** | High — wants free options | Medium | Learn + experiment | Low — needs clear guidance |
