| **CXO / Founder** | Low — ROI is the question | Low-Medium | Business impact, not setup | Very low — skip the jargon |
| **Builder / Tinkerer** | Low — loves free/OSS | Very High | Control + customization | High — wants depth |
| **Other** | Unknown | Unknown | Varies | Medium |
 
